WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:04,650
I was also shocked at that time Xiaotong

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:07,190
What exactly did you do to Mr. Lu?

3
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:09,190
It feels so comfortable to flatter him

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:12,190
The price is 500,000 for Sister Meng

5
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:15,510
Please help me deposit that bank card

6
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:22,470
Help me book a flight to New York

7
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:24,500
I'll leave Alu tomorrow morning

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
He might as well have been called Alu.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,730
This way you will always be mine

10
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:37,740
A debt that no one can take away

11
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:42,020
Why do you like taking the stairwell so much?

12
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,870
You forgot about me so quickly. Don't move.

13
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:49,030
If it collapses again

14
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:51,100
I just kissed him

15
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,320
He's blushing oh my god

16
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,320
There are still such innocent women now

17
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,320
A sparkling stone

18
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,320
You here

19
00:00:57,320 --> 00:01:01,850
I want to confirm something very important

20
00:01:01,850 --> 00:01:02,850
Sorry

21
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:03,850
Sorry to bother you
